1
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:07,130
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:11,080
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:15,810
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:20,970
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:24,960
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:28,210
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:33,480
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:37,440
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:40,440
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:44,810
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,810 --> 00:00:47,800
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:50,650
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:54,000
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:57,170
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,170 --> 00:01:00,250
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,410 --> 00:01:03,130
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,130 --> 00:01:06,570
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,650 --> 00:01:19,010
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,170 --> 00:01:22,090
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:25,210
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,330 --> 00:01:28,170
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,170 --> 00:01:32,810
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:43,440
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:54,700
Demon Spirit Land
East Demon Spirit Sea

25
00:01:53,210 --> 00:01:55,820
How can the spiritual energy in here be so thin ?

26
00:01:55,850 --> 00:01:57,170
It’s no different from the mortal world.

27
00:01:57,890 --> 00:01:59,770
I don't know anything about this place

28
00:02:00,970 --> 00:02:02,970
so I should first find someone to question.

29
00:02:12,770 --> 00:02:13,610
Found it.

30
00:02:20,860 --> 00:02:22,900
Thirteen
Luo Family Tribe

31
00:02:29,410 --> 00:02:30,850
I’ve finally got you.

32
00:02:51,140 --> 00:02:52,740
Luo Family Valley

33
00:02:55,650 --> 00:02:57,210
This formation is exceedingly profound.

34
00:02:58,010 --> 00:02:59,650
It can conceal all signs of life.

35
00:03:00,410 --> 00:03:04,060
It was made with a different method than that of the Cultivation Alliance.

36
00:03:04,490 --> 00:03:06,650
It looks like the work of ancient cultivators.

37
00:03:09,850 --> 00:03:10,450
It’s him !

38
00:03:18,490 --> 00:03:19,410
Where are we ?

39
00:03:21,210 --> 00:03:22,850
And what is this formation guarding ?

40
00:03:23,850 --> 00:03:24,690
I won’t tell you.

41
00:03:25,250 --> 00:03:25,970
If you kill me,

42
00:03:26,330 --> 00:03:27,650
Patriarch Ouyang won’t let you go !

43
00:03:28,290 --> 00:03:29,410
I am Wang Lin,

44
00:03:30,650 --> 00:03:32,930
I request to speak with whoever owns this valley.

45
00:03:35,740 --> 00:03:37,660
Ouyang Hua
Luo Family Tribe Leader

46
00:03:36,370 --> 00:03:37,490
Outsider,

47
00:03:37,810 --> 00:03:39,410
return my tribe members

48
00:03:39,970 --> 00:03:41,450
and fuck off my tribe's territory !

49
00:03:50,010 --> 00:03:51,450
Don't come any closer !

50
00:03:52,290 --> 00:03:54,180
What you're looking for

51
00:03:54,210 --> 00:03:55,370
isn't here !

52
00:03:57,170 --> 00:03:58,650
What I'm looking for ?

53
00:04:04,050 --> 00:04:04,890
An avatar ?

54
00:04:13,810 --> 00:04:14,410
Kill !

55
00:04:18,850 --> 00:04:20,730
This formation uses neither spiritual energy

56
00:04:21,290 --> 00:04:22,250
nor celestial spiritual energy

57
00:04:23,730 --> 00:04:25,900
yet it somehow rivals my Ancient God Restrictions...

58
00:04:27,330 --> 00:04:28,130
Interesting.

59
00:04:30,130 --> 00:04:32,250
I thought you had more tricks up your sleeve

60
00:04:33,010 --> 00:04:34,370
but you’re nothing special.

61
00:04:35,250 --> 00:04:36,410
Die !

62
00:04:45,530 --> 00:04:47,060
No matter how different, it's all the same.

63
00:04:47,090 --> 00:04:48,740
No matter how complex a formation is,

64
00:04:48,770 --> 00:04:50,730
it's always nothing more than a type of restriction.

65
00:04:51,330 --> 00:04:52,980
As long as I can understand it,

66
00:04:53,250 --> 00:04:54,940
it can be unraveled.

67
00:04:59,170 --> 00:04:59,970
Impossible !

68
00:05:00,530 --> 00:05:01,130
Celestial,

69
00:05:01,490 --> 00:05:03,490
you're actually breaking the formation !

70
00:05:04,890 --> 00:05:05,890
Spare me, Celestial !

71
00:05:06,570 --> 00:05:07,330
Ouyang Hua

72
00:05:07,730 --> 00:05:08,610
was wrong.

73
00:05:09,090 --> 00:05:10,970
This formation protects the lives of my tribe.

74
00:05:11,490 --> 00:05:13,020
I beg Celestial to understand,

75
00:05:13,050 --> 00:05:14,130
please don't destroy it.

76
00:05:26,650 --> 00:05:27,800
Open the gate.

77
00:05:43,170 --> 00:05:44,140
Celestial,

78
00:05:44,170 --> 00:05:44,860
please.

79
00:05:48,490 --> 00:05:50,250
They don't have a hint of spiritual energy

80
00:05:50,450 --> 00:05:52,050
yet are able to control this huge formation.

81
00:05:52,810 --> 00:05:53,890
It's really weird...

82
00:05:54,450 --> 00:05:55,490
What's the

83
00:05:56,370 --> 00:05:57,850
mystery of this valley ?

84
00:06:03,810 --> 00:06:06,090
Da Bao, Xiao Bao, come home for dinner !

85
00:06:16,890 --> 00:06:17,820
They’re...

86
00:06:18,330 --> 00:06:19,450
all mortals ?

87
00:06:23,210 --> 00:06:24,500
The child meant no offense,

88
00:06:24,530 --> 00:06:26,330
I hope Celestial doesn't mind.

89
00:06:27,330 --> 00:06:30,090
I assumed such a powerful formation had to be guarding something

90
00:06:31,330 --> 00:06:33,330
but it’s just a village of mortals.

91
00:06:35,250 --> 00:06:37,180
This jade bottle contains several dozen pills

92
00:06:37,330 --> 00:06:38,730
to strengthen your foundation.

93
00:06:39,130 --> 00:06:40,380
I'm sorry for bothering you,

94
00:06:40,650 --> 00:06:41,940
I shall take my leave now.

95
00:06:45,210 --> 00:06:46,050
Celestial, please wait !

96
00:06:47,330 --> 00:06:48,770
The Demon Spirit Night is about to begin.

97
00:06:49,370 --> 00:06:50,730
It's already dusk.

98
00:06:51,210 --> 00:06:52,650
If Celestial doesn’t mind,

99
00:06:53,650 --> 00:06:54,970
please stay here for the night.

100
00:06:55,970 --> 00:06:57,090
Demon Spirit Night ?

101
00:07:00,890 --> 00:07:02,530
On every full moon,

102
00:07:02,850 --> 00:07:05,370
all the demon spirits lurking in the Demon Spirit Land

103
00:07:05,370 --> 00:07:06,690
come out to hunt

104
00:07:07,210 --> 00:07:10,090
and kill every living thing in sight.

105
00:07:10,930 --> 00:07:12,010
Over time,

106
00:07:12,650 --> 00:07:14,210
people began calling this night

107
00:07:14,450 --> 00:07:16,250
the Demon Spirit Night.

108
00:07:17,450 --> 00:07:19,130
Legend has it that countless years ago,

109
00:07:19,890 --> 00:07:23,090
a celestial brought our ancestors here to settle

110
00:07:23,770 --> 00:07:25,490
and laid down this formation

111
00:07:26,170 --> 00:07:29,570
to spare us from the scourge of the Demon Spirit Nights.

112
00:07:30,450 --> 00:07:31,650
Patriarch Huanglong ?

113
00:07:33,130 --> 00:07:35,210
How do you know the name of Celestial Huang Long ?

114
00:07:35,530 --> 00:07:36,970
Do you know him ?

115
00:07:37,660 --> 00:07:38,260
No.

116
00:07:39,850 --> 00:07:42,410
The Huanglong I knew was only at Foundation Establishment.

117
00:07:43,250 --> 00:07:45,170
He can't be the same person as this painting.

118
00:07:46,330 --> 00:07:47,370
I have another question.

119
00:07:47,890 --> 00:07:48,650
You said that

120
00:07:49,090 --> 00:07:51,020
this place doesn’t have what I'm looking for.

121
00:07:51,330 --> 00:07:52,330
What is it exactly ?

122
00:07:56,930 --> 00:07:59,330
That item is tied to the life of my tribe.

123
00:08:00,050 --> 00:08:01,690
If you take it by force,

124
00:08:02,010 --> 00:08:03,940
it will hurt our tribe members' foundations

125
00:08:03,970 --> 00:08:06,140
and they may even wither and die.

126
00:08:06,650 --> 00:08:07,740
That's why

127
00:08:07,970 --> 00:08:11,850
I tried to stop you from entering the tribe.

128
00:08:13,410 --> 00:08:13,930
However,

129
00:08:14,410 --> 00:08:17,010
if Celestial still has those pills you gave us earlier

130
00:08:17,370 --> 00:08:19,490
to strengthen our tribe members' foundations,

131
00:08:20,650 --> 00:08:23,450
we would willingly give Celestial what he's looking for.

132
00:08:24,850 --> 00:08:26,140
Is this enough ?

133
00:08:27,010 --> 00:08:28,450
Yes... it's enough !

134
00:08:29,050 --> 00:08:30,170
Thank you, Celestial.

135
00:08:30,930 --> 00:08:32,050
An outsider’s pills

136
00:08:32,770 --> 00:08:34,810
are worth a fortune in the Demon Spirit Land.

137
00:08:35,450 --> 00:08:36,170
Celestial,

138
00:08:36,450 --> 00:08:37,530
please follow me.

139
00:08:37,930 --> 00:08:39,330
I’ll take you to it.

140
00:08:38,820 --> 00:08:41,900
Back mountain
of the Luo Family Tribe

141
00:08:45,450 --> 00:08:46,580
This fluctuation

142
00:08:46,930 --> 00:08:48,260
isn't celestial spiritual energy.

143
00:08:48,530 --> 00:08:49,730
Celestial's eye is keen.

144
00:08:50,210 --> 00:08:51,580
This isn't celestial spiritual energy.

145
00:08:51,730 --> 00:08:54,290
It's the unique demonic energy of the Demon Spirit Land.

146
00:08:54,660 --> 00:08:57,620
Rank 1 Demon Spirit Crystal

147
00:08:54,610 --> 00:08:55,810
What you're looking for

148
00:08:56,130 --> 00:08:59,220
is precisely this Demon Spirit Crystal, condensed from demonic energy.

149
00:08:59,650 --> 00:09:02,130
No wonder he showed no hints of spiritual energy

150
00:09:03,250 --> 00:09:05,210
but was able to operate the formation.

151
00:09:05,930 --> 00:09:07,420
The Demon Spirit Crystal

152
00:09:07,610 --> 00:09:10,290
must be the key in this Demon Spirit Land.

153
00:09:20,690 --> 00:09:21,650
I will cultivate here.

154
00:09:22,810 --> 00:09:23,820
You may leave.

155
00:09:23,970 --> 00:09:24,530
Understood.

156
00:09:38,810 --> 00:09:40,220
We'll make it through the night

157
00:09:40,250 --> 00:09:41,250
and we'll survive !

158
00:09:44,050 --> 00:09:46,340
The demon spirits seem unusually fierce tonight.

159
00:09:47,170 --> 00:09:48,770
If the formation can’t hold,

160
00:09:49,370 --> 00:09:49,970
will...

161
00:09:51,210 --> 00:09:52,610
Will he help us ?

162
00:10:07,770 --> 00:10:08,210
Patriarch !

163
00:10:09,010 --> 00:10:11,020
Why is the demonic energy so strong tonight ?

164
00:10:11,090 --> 00:10:12,450
How can it be this powerful !?

165
00:10:14,250 --> 00:10:14,730
Hold the line !

166
00:10:15,770 --> 00:10:16,330
What do we do ?

167
00:10:17,450 --> 00:10:18,250
Don’t panic !

168
00:10:30,850 --> 00:10:31,650
It’s over !

169
00:10:32,850 --> 00:10:34,290
We’re all doomed !

170
00:10:39,010 --> 00:10:39,610
Celestial !

171
00:10:39,610 --> 00:10:40,570
The Celestial has come !

172
00:10:57,130 --> 00:10:58,300
Return to the valley !

173
00:11:00,450 --> 00:11:02,050
Whoever you are,

174
00:11:02,370 --> 00:11:03,330
show yourself !

175
00:11:12,290 --> 00:11:13,330
Your cultivation isn't bad

176
00:11:14,410 --> 00:11:16,370
to be able to sense my presence.

177
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:16,500
Luo Yun
Heavenly Ghost Sect
Peak Late stage Soul Transformation

178
00:11:21,290 --> 00:11:23,170
Are you from the Da Lou Sword Sect ?

179
00:11:25,970 --> 00:11:27,570
Out of respect for your sect,

180
00:11:28,250 --> 00:11:30,180
if you hand over your Demon Spirit Crystal,

181
00:11:30,330 --> 00:11:31,690
I’ll spare your life.

182
00:11:34,330 --> 00:11:36,170
That's what you get for refusing my kindness !

183
00:11:39,530 --> 00:11:40,730
Death Finger !

184
00:11:48,730 --> 00:11:49,570
This spell...

185
00:11:50,330 --> 00:11:52,530
It's the same one that I saw at the All-Seer's birthday...

186
00:11:53,490 --> 00:11:54,130
You

187
00:11:54,290 --> 00:11:56,570
are the All-Seer's new disciple !

188
00:11:57,330 --> 00:11:58,610
The Seventh Purple Disciple,

189
00:11:59,650 --> 00:12:00,690
Wang Lin !

190
00:12:01,850 --> 00:12:03,330
This man can fight an Ascendant...

191
00:12:03,690 --> 00:12:04,730
If I knew it was him,

192
00:12:05,330 --> 00:12:06,610
I wouldn't have provoked him.

193
00:12:09,050 --> 00:12:10,290
You can’t escape.

194
00:12:12,450 --> 00:12:13,810
Even if you’re a prodigy,

195
00:12:14,730 --> 00:12:16,540
you’re only at Middle stage Soul Transformation !

196
00:12:17,450 --> 00:12:18,210
You

197
00:12:18,810 --> 00:12:20,170
are pushing your luck !

198
00:12:24,010 --> 00:12:24,890
Forbidden Devil,

199
00:12:25,530 --> 00:12:27,970
Fourth Heavenly Ghost !

200
00:12:52,970 --> 00:12:54,730
You forced me to wound my own Origin Soul

201
00:12:54,970 --> 00:12:56,290
and use a forbidden spell !

202
00:12:56,810 --> 00:12:57,690
You deserve

203
00:12:58,370 --> 00:12:59,330
to die !

204
00:13:06,730 --> 00:13:07,530
A soul ?

205
00:13:09,490 --> 00:13:10,610
It was about time.

206
00:13:21,570 --> 00:13:23,980
This will allow the Soul Lasher to evolve.

207
00:13:24,130 --> 00:13:25,890
The Heavenly Ghost’s soul

208
00:13:26,290 --> 00:13:28,330
will feed the Soul Lasher !

209
00:13:32,050 --> 00:13:33,530
An artifact specialized in damaging souls ?

210
00:13:54,930 --> 00:13:56,530
Welcome back, Celestial !

211
00:13:57,050 --> 00:13:58,970
Welcome back, Celestial !

212
00:13:59,530 --> 00:14:01,100
I’ll borrow your back mountain.

213
00:14:01,290 --> 00:14:02,250
Don't disturb me

214
00:14:03,050 --> 00:14:04,010
unless it’s urgent.

215
00:14:07,850 --> 00:14:08,930
From now on,

216
00:14:09,210 --> 00:14:10,810
the back mountain is a forbidden area.

217
00:14:11,250 --> 00:14:12,130
It's off limits !

218
00:14:12,970 --> 00:14:14,130
This is the tribe's rule.

219
00:14:14,930 --> 00:14:15,940
Those who violate it

220
00:14:16,090 --> 00:14:17,620
will be banished outside

221
00:14:17,650 --> 00:14:18,730
to fend for themselves !

222
00:14:19,090 --> 00:14:19,850
Understood.

223
00:14:27,810 --> 00:14:30,210
Disciples of the Heavenly Ghost Sect are protected by ghost spirits.

224
00:14:31,010 --> 00:14:32,010
If you kill me,

225
00:14:32,610 --> 00:14:35,210
my master, Daoist Ghost, will avenge me !

226
00:14:36,170 --> 00:14:38,050
Even the All-Seer

227
00:14:38,530 --> 00:14:41,250
treats my master as a peer !

228
00:14:42,170 --> 00:14:42,970
Wang Lin,

229
00:14:43,330 --> 00:14:44,810
think carefully !

230
00:14:48,770 --> 00:14:50,770
You dare to Soul Search me !?

231
00:14:51,410 --> 00:14:54,570
My master will never let you go !

232
00:14:59,890 --> 00:15:02,220
The Demon Spirit Land is divided into 9 countries.

233
00:15:02,450 --> 00:15:04,090
Each country is ruled by a Demon Emperor

234
00:15:05,130 --> 00:15:06,930
and has over 100 cities governed by

235
00:15:07,610 --> 00:15:09,810
8 Demon Generals under the Demon Emperor.

236
00:15:10,850 --> 00:15:12,090
These 9 countries

237
00:15:12,730 --> 00:15:15,500
each belong to one of the 9 Ancient Demon Spirits

238
00:15:15,570 --> 00:15:17,130
that live in this place.

239
00:15:19,010 --> 00:15:21,060
Fusing with an Ancient Demon Spirit

240
00:15:21,530 --> 00:15:24,410
is the true goal of us cultivators.

241
00:15:25,770 --> 00:15:29,380
Ancient Demon Spirits are naturally born of heaven and earth.

242
00:15:29,530 --> 00:15:31,460
If a cultivator fuses with one,

243
00:15:31,610 --> 00:15:33,340
not only will their cultivation surge

244
00:15:33,370 --> 00:15:35,170
but they’ll also gain heaven-defying abilities.

245
00:15:36,610 --> 00:15:38,820
Luo Yun’s memories even mention a rumor.

246
00:15:38,890 --> 00:15:40,370
Those who fuse with an Ancient Demon Spirit

247
00:15:41,010 --> 00:15:41,970
have a tiny chance

248
00:15:42,450 --> 00:15:44,890
of entering a state known as the Beginning of the Soul.

249
00:15:46,410 --> 00:15:47,490
Beginning of the Soul ?

250
00:15:48,810 --> 00:15:49,570
Could it be...

251
00:15:50,130 --> 00:15:51,290
the Shi Realm ?

252
00:15:51,810 --> 00:15:56,450
Ji Realm

253
00:15:51,820 --> 00:15:56,460
Shi Realm

254
00:15:53,820 --> 00:15:56,460
Dao Realm

255
00:15:52,850 --> 00:15:56,010
The 3 legendary realms involve spiritual energy and Divine Sense.

256
00:15:57,170 --> 00:15:58,900
If I grasp Death from the Ji Realm

257
00:15:59,170 --> 00:16:00,650
and Life from the Shi Realm,

258
00:16:01,370 --> 00:16:03,500
my Dao of Life and Death

259
00:16:03,530 --> 00:16:05,370
might one day reach a higher state.

260
00:16:08,010 --> 00:16:10,490
It's too early to be thinking about this.

261
00:16:11,850 --> 00:16:12,770
According to Luo Yun,

262
00:16:13,410 --> 00:16:14,770
only with enough demonic energy

263
00:16:15,410 --> 00:16:16,890
and by accumulating military merit

264
00:16:17,690 --> 00:16:20,370
can one earn an audience with the Ancient Demon Spirit.

265
00:16:21,930 --> 00:16:23,330
I'm currently in the Sky Demon Country

266
00:16:24,170 --> 00:16:26,210
and the nearest city is Ancient Demon City.

267
00:16:27,370 --> 00:16:28,570
Luo Yun invaded the valley

268
00:16:29,130 --> 00:16:31,050
for this rank 1 Demon Spirit Crystal

269
00:16:31,460 --> 00:16:34,020
Rank 2 Demon Spirit Crystal

270
00:16:31,650 --> 00:16:34,010
to merge it with his rank 2 crystal

271
00:16:34,490 --> 00:16:37,140
and gain qualifications to enter Ancient Demon City.

272
00:16:34,380 --> 00:16:37,300
Rank 3 Demon Spirit Crystal

273
00:16:37,770 --> 00:16:39,410
Then, as a soldier in the army,

274
00:16:40,090 --> 00:16:42,210
he would join in campaigns

275
00:16:43,010 --> 00:16:44,210
to accumulate merit

276
00:16:45,450 --> 00:16:47,020
and rise through the ranks.

277
00:16:47,410 --> 00:16:50,130
This is the path most cultivators will choose to follow.

278
00:16:57,370 --> 00:16:59,090
But joining the army as a soldier

279
00:16:59,610 --> 00:17:01,420
would leave me at the mercy of others.

280
00:17:01,970 --> 00:17:02,610
In that case,

281
00:17:03,370 --> 00:17:06,220
it might be better to teach the tribe how to make Soul Flags

282
00:17:06,450 --> 00:17:08,930
to build an army of my own.

283
00:17:14,670 --> 00:19:18,940
Quick reminder of the 3 legendary realms of spiritual energy and Divine Sense because it was never really explained in the donghua.

- The Ji Realm, the extreme realm that grants unprecedented power and represents Death.
- The Shi Realm, if Ji is Death then Shi is Life.
- The Dao Realm, the most sought after and the most mysterious.

Wang Lin lacks information at the moment about the Shi and Dao Realms.

284
00:17:20,380 --> 00:17:26,020
I've been walking this path for endless years

285
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:26,020
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

286
00:17:26,660 --> 00:17:31,620
Is it the compass of fate

287
00:17:28,500 --> 00:17:31,620
that wrote this outcome for us ?

288
00:17:31,780 --> 00:17:37,540
The heavens want to erase your existence,

289
00:17:37,660 --> 00:17:43,260
that's the obsession guiding me.

290
00:17:43,540 --> 00:17:48,860
Is this the path to uncover

291
00:17:45,420 --> 00:17:48,860
truths from falsehoods ?

292
00:17:49,140 --> 00:17:54,460
In a world of murk and shadow,

293
00:17:51,040 --> 00:17:54,460
only the flame of truth can light the way.

294
00:17:54,500 --> 00:18:00,180
Look at them all,

295
00:17:57,380 --> 00:18:00,180
being carried by the waves.

296
00:18:00,620 --> 00:18:04,820
Look at them all,

297
00:18:02,780 --> 00:18:04,820
being drowned.

298
00:18:04,900 --> 00:18:08,140
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

299
00:18:08,180 --> 00:18:11,220
I will let the world refine my soul.

300
00:18:11,350 --> 00:18:16,780
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

301
00:18:13,040 --> 00:18:16,780
I will fight.

302
00:18:16,780 --> 00:18:19,900
I'll break through the abyss of despair

303
00:18:19,900 --> 00:18:22,940
to finally learn who I really am.

304
00:18:22,940 --> 00:18:28,300
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

305
00:18:24,820 --> 00:18:28,300
I embrace this obsession.

306
00:18:28,300 --> 00:18:31,260
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

307
00:18:31,260 --> 00:18:34,060
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

308
00:18:34,060 --> 00:18:39,540
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

309
00:18:36,100 --> 00:18:39,540
I'll still fight.

310
00:18:39,740 --> 00:18:42,900
It's hard to avoid loneliness

311
00:18:42,900 --> 00:18:45,940
when you are above everyone else.

312
00:18:45,940 --> 00:18:51,620
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

313
00:18:48,260 --> 00:18:51,620
be afraid of a firefly ?
